#: KSameWidget.cpp:205
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: One stone removed.\n"
"%n stones removed."
msgstr ""
"एउटा ढुङ्गा हटाइयो ।\n"
"%n ढुङ्गा हटाइयो"

#: KSameWidget.cpp:216
#, c-format
msgid "Score: %1"
msgstr "प्राप्ताङ्क: %1"

#: KSameWidget.cpp:224
msgid ""
"You even removed the last stone, great job! This gave you a score of %1 in "
"total."
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले अन्तिम ढुङ्गा पनि हटाउनु भयो, धेरै राम्रो काम ! यसले तपाईँलाई कूलमा %1 "
"अङ्क दियो ।"

#: KSameWidget.cpp:228
msgid "There are no more removeable stones. You got a score of %1 in total."
msgstr ""
"अब त्यहाँ हटाउने ढुङ्गा छैन । तपाईँले कूलमा %1 अङ्क प्राप्त गर्नु भयो ।"

